sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Operator as Training Operator<br/>Controller Manager
    participant CertCtrl as cert-controller
    participant OpenShift as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io
    participant Workers as Worker Pods
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8080/TCP TLS

    Note over Operator,OpenShift: Startup Sequence
    Operator->>OpenShift: GET config.openshift.io/v1/APIServer<br/>(10s timeout, hardened fallback)
    OpenShift-->>Operator: TLS Profile Configuration
    Operator->>CertCtrl: Initialize certificate rotation
    CertCtrl-->>Operator: Webhook + Metrics certs ready
    Operator->>Operator: Register 6 reconcilers + 5 webhooks
    Operator->>Operator: Readiness probe gates on<br/>cert readiness + webhook availability

    Note over User,Workers: Job Submission Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply -f pytorchjob.yaml<br/>POST kubeflow.org/v1/PyTorchJob
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review (CREATE)<br/>/validate-kubeflow-org-v1-pytorchjob<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission auth
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allowed/denied)
    K8sAPI-->>User: PyTorchJob created

    Note over Operator,Workers: Reconciliation Loop
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: PyTorchJob created<br/>Label-selector filtered cache
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount<br/>for training job
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Role + RoleBinding<br/>for training job
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>for worker communication
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>for job isolation
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Worker Pods<br/>(master + workers)

    opt Gang Scheduling Enabled
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create PodGroup<br/>(Volcano or scheduler-plugins)
    end

    opt Elastic Training (PyTorch only)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create HorizontalPodAutoscaler
    end

    K8sAPI-->>Workers: Pods scheduled and running

    Note over Operator,Workers: Status Updates
    Workers-->>K8sAPI: Pod status updates
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: Pod status changed
    Operator->>K8sAPI: PATCH PyTorchJob/status<br/>(Running → Succeeded/Failed)

    Note over Prometheus,Operator: Metrics Collection
    Prometheus->>Operator: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP TLS<br/>prometheus.io/scrape annotation
    Operator-->>Prometheus: Training job metrics
